        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Admin as Administrator\n    participant IAP as Identity-Aware Proxy&lt;br/&gt;(35.235.240.0/20)\n    participant FW as VPC Firewall Rule&lt;br/&gt;(Target Tag: web-bastion)\n    participant VM as Private Compute Instance&lt;br/&gt;(app-vm-1: 10.10.1.x)\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;IAP: 1. Authenticate via Google Identity + IAM\n    Note over Admin,IAP: Role: roles/iap.tunnelResourceAccessor\n    IAP-&gt;&gt;FW: 2. Tunnel TCP traffic over WebSocket\n    Note over IAP,FW: Source IP matches 35.235.240.0/20\n    FW-&gt;&gt;VM: 3. Match target tag &#39;web-bastion&#39; -&gt; Allow port 22 / 80\n    VM--&gt;&gt;Admin: 4. Secure interactive shell session&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="TUC7z0Ds44rXWtR79U07-1">
